	2023-03-26: modified for ONIX for Books release 3.1
	            1. extended and modified cardinality of <EpubLicense> in <DescriptiveDetail>, added <EpubUsageConstraint>, extended <EpubLicense> and <Publisher> in <ContentItem> (to support hybrid open access)
	            2. added <AffiliationIdentifier> in <ProfessionalAffiliation> (to support RORs and similar)
	            3. added <SequenceNumber> in <TextContent>, <SupportingResource>, <CitedContent>, <Prize> (to prioritize multiple collateral items of the same type, eg multiple reviews)
