	            5. added <CollectionElementLevel> in <CollectionIdentifier> (to disambiguate collection identifier referents in collections, sub-collections)
	            6. added <MainAudience/> flag in <Audience> (to prioritize multiple audiences)
	            7. added <TextSourceLink> in <TextContent> (primarily to enable reference to full text of reviews)
	            8. added <AwardingBody> within <Prize>
	            9. added <MarketReference> within <ProductSupply> (to enable more granular per-market Block updates)
	           10. modified cardinality of <CorporateName>, <CorporateNameInverted> within <Contributor> and <NameAsSubject>, and modified cardinality of <PublisherName> in <Publisher> (to enable multi-language naming)
	           11. minor changes to regularize structure of <ProductContact>, <SupplyContact>, <NewSupplier>, <PublisherRepresentative>
	           12. removed previously deprecated elements <AudienceCode>, <Conference>, <CurrencyZone>, <DateFormat>, <PromotionContact>, <Reissue>, <SalesRestriction> OUTSIDE <SalesRights>, old <UnnamedPersons> location (loss of back compatibility bumps release number to 3.1)
	           13. removed <Gender> (despite no previous deprecation)
	           14. deprecated defaults in <Header> plus <TitleText> (in documentation)
	           15. extended some recommended max character lengths (in documentation)
	           16. updated release attribute, changed XML namespace to http://ns.editeur.org/onix/3.1/reference, changed DOIs of specification documentation

